{"3232870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "King of Tokyo - Richard Garfield", "steam_appid": 3232870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232870/extras/2fb79adb0ea2e95e1f563de9ffe26c41.poster.avif?t=1779378972\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232870/extras/2fb79adb0ea2e95e1f563de9ffe26c41.webm?t=1779378972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232870/extras/2fb79adb0ea2e95e1f563de9ffe26c41.mp4?t=1779378972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a kaiju as you destroy everything in your path in this board game! </strong></h2><br>Turn into a kaiju as you destroy everything in your path in this fast-paced dice game! Roll the dice and find the best possible combinations to rule over Tokyo, whether you choose to heal yourself, attack, buy cards or win Victory Points.<br><br>Adapt your strategy to become the King of Tokyo at the right moment and attack all your opponents at the same time.<br><br>The first player to reach 20 Victory Points wins the game... and so does the last player to stay alive!<br><br><strong>Build your strategy </strong><br>Roll the dice and choose wisely which ones to keep. Whether you decide to keep your dice or reroll, each decision is crucial to your winning strategy. Turn into a glass canon with powerful cards to reduce your opponents' hit points to 0, play it safe and quickly collect Victory Points, or build up health to become a tank: the choice is yours. <br><br><strong>Choose your kaiju</strong><br>Unleash the kaiju within you and rule over Tokyo! The mighty Gigazaur, the cute Cyber Kitty or maybe the otherworldly Alienoid, choose the invader that suits you best.<br><br><strong>Battle over Tokyo against AI or against your friends</strong><br>Test your strategies by competing against the AI in the solo mode, and find the strategy that matches you.<br>Challenge up to 5 of your friends in the couch multiplayer mode to prove who the mightiest kaiju is! <br><br><strong>A unique recreation</strong><br>(Re)discover King of Tokyo in a dynamic recreation of the critically acclaimed board game.<br>Immerse yourself in the ukiyo-e inspired art style (Japanese woodblock prints and painting style).", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232870/extras/2fb79adb0ea2e95e1f563de9ffe26c41.poster.avif?t=1779378972\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232870/extras/2fb79adb0ea2e95e1f563de9ffe26c41.webm?t=1779378972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232870/extras/2fb79adb0ea2e95e1f563de9ffe26c41.mp4?t=1779378972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a kaiju as you destroy everything in your path in this board game! </strong></h2><br>Turn into a kaiju as you destroy everything in your path in this fast-paced dice game! Roll the dice and find the best possible combinations to rule over Tokyo, whether you choose to heal yourself, attack, buy cards or win Victory Points.<br><br>Adapt your strategy to become the King of Tokyo at the right moment and attack all your opponents at the same time.<br><br>The first player to reach 20 Victory Points wins the game... and so does the last player to stay alive!<br><br><strong>Build your strategy </strong><br>Roll the dice and choose wisely which ones to keep. Whether you decide to keep your dice or reroll, each decision is crucial to your winning strategy. Turn into a glass canon wi